# Consumed by Cloudflare Pages at deploy time. Never served.
#
# Portolan's Data Storage requirements (PORTO-CORE-043 through 045) are written
# for an object store with a CORS policy. This file is how a git-deployed static
# host satisfies the same requirements. Deleting it makes the published catalog
# fail PTL-LIV-003, PTL-LIV-004, and PTL-LIV-005.

/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, HEAD
  Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Range, If-Match, If-Modified-Since, If-None-Match, If-Unmodified-Since
  Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Type, Content-Length, Content-Range, Accept-Ranges, ETag
